---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact Invoice Workshop" description="Contact Invoice Workshop with product feedback, privacy questions or accessibility issues." path="/contact/">
  <article class="simple-page"><p class="eyebrow">Contact</p><h1>How can we help?</h1><p class="lead">Feedback from real businesses helps us make the document workflow clearer and more dependable.</p><h2>Product and general questions</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@invoiceworkshop.com">hello@invoiceworkshop.com</a>.</p><h2>Privacy</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:privacy@invoiceworkshop.com">privacy@invoiceworkshop.com</a>. Please do not attach invoices or include customer, banking, tax or other sensitive document information.</p><h2>Accessibility</h2><p>If a control is difficult to use with your keyboard, screen reader, zoom settings or other assistive technology, tell us what page and browser you used. Do not send the contents of your document.</p><div class="callout">Invoice Workshop does not currently offer account recovery because there are no accounts. Workspace data lives in your browser; use Export backup regularly if you need a portable copy.</div></article>
</BaseLayout>
